<title>SPAIN: Corp Mapfre H1 premiums rise 25.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Corp Mapfre H1 premiums rise 25.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's insurance group Corporacion Mapfre said on Monday its premium income in the first half rose 25.3 percent.</p>
<p>The group also said it would report first-half results in late August.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34  1585 2167</p>
</text>
